"""
The `Slip` launch on both wheels of one axle, with the normal load from a
`Body.Longitudinal.AxleLoad` (m = 1400 kg, share = 0.55, h/L = 0.17) whose `load_left` and
`load_right` flanges wire straight to the two tires' `load` flanges. Each wheel is half the `Slip`
launch: 300 N m drives a J = 0.5 kg m² wheel inertia, and both tires push one 1400 kg mass that the
axle load also follows. One road multiplier feeds both tires and is set per case, and so is the
force `lift` pushes on the axle's `downforce` flange: none but in `lifted`.

The two wheels are identical, so each carries half the axle's load and passes half its tire
force, F_n = F_z/2 and F_x,wheel = F_x/2, with F_x the axle's total. Each wheel then accelerates at
(300 - r F_x/2)/0.5 = 600 - r F_x, the single-wheel `Slip` launch's value. Once the 0.1 s pitch
lag has settled, the axle carries F_z = 0.55 m g + m a h/L with a = F_x/m:

- `wheelspin`, mu_scale = 0.2: the tires slide, F_x = 0.2 · 0.7 F_z = 0.14 F_z, so
  F_z = 0.55 · 1400 · 9.80665 + 0.14 · 0.17 F_z, F_z = 7551.1205/0.9762 = 7735.2187 N, and each
  wheel carries 3867.6094 N; at the start, before any transfer, 7551.1205/2 = 3775.5603 N. Then
  F_x = 1082.9306 N, a = 0.773522 m/s², and each wheel accelerates at
  600 - 0.31 · 1082.9306 = 264.29151 rad/s². Each tire's grip ceiling,
  0.31 · 0.2 · 3867.6 = 239.8 N m, stays below its 300 N m, so the slide holds. The lag settles
  at a rate of (1 - 0.0238)/0.1 = 9.76 1/s, so by 2 s it is complete to within e^-19.5.
- `grip`, mu_scale = 1: as in the `Slip` rig, steady slip gives
  F_x = (tau r/J)/(r²/J + (1 + kappa)/m) for the axle's 600 N m on its 1 kg m², now with
  mu(kappa) = F_x/F_z and F_z = 0.55 m g + F_x h/L. Iterating from kappa = 0 settles at
  kappa = 0.0065620, F_x = 1921.111 N and F_z = 7877.709 N, 3938.8545 N per wheel, so
  a = 1.372222 m/s². The slip settles within milliseconds, as in the `Slip` rig; the weight
  transfer of 1400 · 1.372 · 0.17 = 326.6 N follows the 0.1 s lag, so by 2 s it is within
  326.6 e^-20 = 7e-7 N.
- `lifted`, 20000 N of lift on a dry road: the axle's static share alone would be
  0.55 (1400 · 9.80665 - 20000) = -3448.8795 N, so the axle is off the road and `F_z` stays at 0.
  The tires pass no force, the mass stays at rest, a = 0, so no weight transfers, while each
  wheel's whole 300 N m spins it up at 300/0.5 = 600 rad/s².
"""
test component LoadedSlip
  drive_left = RotationalComponents.Sources.ConstantTorque(tau_constant = 300.0) {^drive_left}
  housing_left = RotationalComponents.Components.Fixed() {^housing_left}
  inertia_left = RotationalComponents.Components.Inertia(J = 0.5, phi = initial 0.0, w = initial 0.0) {^inertia_left}
  wheel_left = VehicleComponents.Chassis.Wheel.LoadedSlip() {^wheel_left}
  drive_right = RotationalComponents.Sources.ConstantTorque(tau_constant = 300.0) {^drive_right}
  housing_right = RotationalComponents.Components.Fixed() {^housing_right}
  inertia_right = RotationalComponents.Components.Inertia(J = 0.5, phi = initial 0.0, w = initial 0.0) {^inertia_right}
  wheel_right = VehicleComponents.Chassis.Wheel.LoadedSlip() {^wheel_right}
  body = TranslationalComponents.Components.Mass(m = 1400.0, s = initial 0.0, v = initial 0.0) {^body}
  axle = VehicleComponents.Body.Longitudinal.AxleLoad(m = 1400.0, share = 0.55, h_over_L = 0.17) {^axle}
  "Downforce, negative for lift; overridden per case"
  lift = TranslationalComponents.Sources.ConstantForce(f_constant = 0.0) {^lift}
  ground = TranslationalComponents.Components.Fixed() {^ground}
  "Road-friction multiplier under both wheels, overridden per case"
  road = BlockComponents.Sources.Constant(k = 1.0) {^road}
relations
  connect(drive_left.spline, inertia_left.spline_a) {^id10}
  connect(drive_left.support, housing_left.spline) {^id11}
  connect(inertia_left.spline_b, wheel_left.spline) {^id12}
  connect(wheel_left.flange, body.flange_a) {^id13}
  connect(drive_right.spline, inertia_right.spline_a) {^id20}
  connect(drive_right.support, housing_right.spline) {^id21}
  connect(inertia_right.spline_b, wheel_right.spline) {^id22}
  connect(wheel_right.flange, body.flange_b) {^id23}
  connect(axle.flange, body.flange_b) {^id14}
  connect(axle.load_left, wheel_left.load) {^id15}
  connect(axle.load_right, wheel_right.load) {^id25}
  connect(lift.flange, axle.downforce) {^id16}
  connect(lift.support, ground.flange) {^id17}
  connect(road.y, wheel_left.mu_scale) {^id18}
  connect(road.y, wheel_right.mu_scale) {^id28}
metadata {
  "Dyad": {
    "tests": {
      "wheelspin": {
        "stop": 2,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-8,
        "reltol": 1e-8,
        "params": {"road.k": 0.2},
        "atol": {
          "axle.F_z": 0.001,
          "wheel_left.F_n": 0.001,
          "wheel_right.F_n": 0.001,
          "body.a": 1e-6,
          "inertia_left.a": 0.0001,
          "inertia_right.a": 0.0001
        },
        "expect": {
          "initial": {"wheel_left.F_n": 3775.5603, "wheel_right.F_n": 3775.5603},
          "final": {
            "axle.F_z": 7735.2187,
            "wheel_left.F_n": 3867.6094,
            "wheel_right.F_n": 3867.6094,
            "body.a": 0.773522,
            "inertia_left.a": 264.29151,
            "inertia_right.a": 264.29151
          }
        }
      },
      "grip": {
        "stop": 2,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-8,
        "reltol": 1e-8,
        "atol": {
          "wheel_left.kappa": 1e-6,
          "wheel_right.kappa": 1e-6,
          "wheel_left.F_n": 0.001,
          "wheel_right.F_n": 0.001,
          "body.a": 1e-5
        },
        "expect": {
          "final": {
            "wheel_left.kappa": 0.006562,
            "wheel_right.kappa": 0.006562,
            "wheel_left.F_n": 3938.8545,
            "wheel_right.F_n": 3938.8545,
            "body.a": 1.372222
          }
        }
      },
      "lifted": {
        "stop": 1,
        "solver": "Auto",
        "abstol": 1e-8,
        "reltol": 1e-8,
        "params": {"lift.f_constant": -20000.0},
        "atol": {
          "axle.F_z": 0.001,
          "wheel_left.F_x": 1e-6,
          "wheel_right.F_x": 1e-6,
          "body.a": 1e-6,
          "inertia_left.a": 1e-4,
          "inertia_right.a": 1e-4
        },
        "expect": {
          "final": {
            "axle.F_z": 0.0,
            "wheel_left.F_x": 0.0,
            "wheel_right.F_x": 0.0,
            "body.a": 0.0,
            "inertia_left.a": 600.0,
            "inertia_right.a": 600.0
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
